# HP50g stock ARMToolbox install.
# x49gp's HPGCC2 quick-start sequence is:
#   2, SETUP.BIN, 3, ->TAG, RCL, EVAL, ON+C.
# Selecting SETUP.BIN in the stock SD File Manager already supplies the :3:
# tagged file reference, so F4/RCL is the UI-equivalent recall step.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
6500 tap two
6800 tap enter
7600 capture port-number
8200 chord lshift files
10400 capture files
10700 tap up
11000 tap f6
12700 capture sd
13200 tap enter
14000 capture sd-setup
14500 tap f4
16000 capture recalled
16500 tap on
17500 capture recalled-home
18000 tap eval
19600 capture evaluated
20600 chord on f3
22600 capture warmstart
23600 finish-install
